### Kirana — poke the API from inside VS Code (REST Client extension)
### Click "Send Request" above any block below.

@host = http://localhost:3000
@merchant = bluehill-example

### Is it alive
GET {{host}}/health

### Every ingested merchant, with its generated MCP endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/merchants

### Ingest a real storefront (Shopify stores work with no cooperation needed)
POST {{host}}/api/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "bluetokaicoffee.com" }

### Browse what an agent would see
GET {{host}}/api/merchants/{{merchant}}/products?q=coffee

### The audit trail, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/audit?limit=25

### Re-walk the hash chain and prove nothing was tampered with
GET {{host}}/api/audit/verify


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### MCP — talk to the merchant exactly as a buyer agent would
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Handshake
POST {{host}}/mcp/{{merchant}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize",
  "params": { "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {},
              "clientInfo": { "name": "rest-client", "version": "0" } } }

### 2. What tools does a buyer get
POST {{host}}/mcp/{{merchant}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list" }

### 3. Who am I shopping from (note: discloses whether a model read the catalog)
POST {{host}}/mcp/{{merchant}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call",
  "params": { "name": "get_merchant_info", "arguments": {} } }

### 4. Search within a budget
POST {{host}}/mcp/{{merchant}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "method": "tools/call",
  "params": { "name": "search_products",
              "arguments": { "query": "coffee", "max_price_inr": 600, "in_stock_only": true } } }

### 5. Get a signed quote — paste a variant_id from step 4
POST {{host}}/mcp/{{merchant}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "method": "tools/call",
  "params": { "name": "create_quote",
              "arguments": { "items": [{ "variant_id": "PASTE_VARIANT_ID", "quantity": 2 }] } } }

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Reconcile now (settles paid orders without any webhook)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json

{}
